        observations.append(dict(path=str(p),sha256=pin,bytes=size,passes=[r[1]for r in passes],copy_path=copy,copy_observation=cm))
    checks=['Full9971B publisher, all six complete selected new sections/checkpoint9077 and frozen context/handoff read. Complete accepted032 publisher bytes reconstructed by exactly three declared identity substitutions; all source algorithms/guards retained.', 'All78 original-copy pairs and both full032 staged cohorts inspected byteexact. Five current032 baselines exact against accepted032 candidates; full032 prior history suffix3/prefix2 retained. All87 links extracted/reconstructed from final document locations.', 'Synthetic25 direct/subtests/events and physical19-second conservative bracket match genuine4b33/f73/fc8e/8bb and ACK002 producer/localcopy. Initial yield10.0141579 is not total; no old19 replay, real metadata/native or OS/whole quiet inference.', 'Constructor002 actual131072-cap prewrite refusal preserves computed-size absence, spent invocation and Root-owned INIT stop/reap attribution; static gate006/007 discrepancy not an actual Source-Pool execution.', 'Actual nonpublishing diagnostic reports134174/133592 and3102/2520 over unchanged131072; composer27939/27819 fits. Persisted decoded genuine toolJSON not raw stdout proof. No bound/model/projection/helper-main outputs or fresh successor fit.', 'Choice002 physical_provenance three identities, unchanged stages canonicalconfig001 and byte-identical futureconfig002 precision retained. Pipeline007 candidate exact seven-literal reversal to006; no different successor fullpeer selected into this cohort. Old3747/130427 arithmetic is Root-attributed Source preparation, not new fit.', 'All nine named model/READY/metadataGO roles absent at this finite read; source snapshots qualified to selected cohort. Owner ongoing/endNone distinct finitelease end; current24/Raw58/Meta30+2/Native128 UNRUN and600/both90/resource60/510reserve/450+after60/caps unchanged.']
